ocal correction) \"sigFigs\" -- accuracy of timestamps \"snapLen\" -- maximum packet size \"network\" -- data link type \"count\" -- total number of packets read in this file. Your program will have to calculate this and for each packet   a packet number, starting at 0 (See posted format) \"tmSec\" -- timestamp seconds \"tmUSec\" -- timestamp microseconds \"inclLen\" -- number of octets/bytes of packet in the pcap file \"origLen\" -- number of octets/byets of packet on the network (will be same as inclLen unless bigger than snapLen  Sample output format: (newlines don't matter here. Also, order of fields in {...}  don't matter. ","topics":[],"score":237210,"global_rank":92889},{"name":"shahzahans/DSA","owner":"shahzahans","html_url":"https://github.com/shahzahans/DSA","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237204,"global_rank":92916},{"name":"datduyng/mini-infinity-mirror","owner":"datduyng","html_url":"https://github.com/datduyng/mini-infinity-mirror","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Mini 4inch infinity mirror","topics":["arduino","art","cad-design","cpp","electronic-arts","fusion-360","nodemcu-esp8266","nodemcu-wifi"],"score":237200,"global_rank":92942},{"name":"phamav/phamavProject3","owner":"phamav","html_url":"https://github.com/phamav/phamavProject3","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics":[],"score":237200,"global_rank":92949},{"name":"phytoporg/burndbg","owner":"phytoporg","html_url":"https://github.com/phytoporg/burndbg","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":"Windbg extension for FBNeo RE","topics":[],"score":237198,"global_rank":92956},{"name":"LeeMclafferty/Simple2D-DrawingApplication","owner":"LeeMclafferty","html_url":"https://github.com/LeeMclafferty/Simple2D-DrawingApplication","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"C++","description":null,"topics"